    "2 / 2" : {
      "comment" : "Text displayed in the trailing section of the top bar, showing the current and total number of calibrations.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "2 / 4" : {
      "comment" : "The step number and total number of steps for the current step in the setup process.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "3 / 4" : {
      "comment" : "The step number for the aligning screen.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "A family-run centre in Denpasar that documents, reconstructs and repatriates endangered classical gamelan. Vaughan Hatch founded it in 2000 around an antique Semara Pagulingan he restored, having found how few classical ensembles were ever recorded. Putu Evie Suyadnyani, a Legong dancer, brought the dance in 2004." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sanggar keluarga di Denpasar yang mendokumentasikan, merekonstruksi, dan mengembalikan gamelan klasik yang hampir punah. Vaughan Hatch mendirikannya pada tahun 2000, berawal dari sebuah Semara Pagulingan antik yang ia pugar, setelah tahu betapa sedikit gamelan klasik yang pernah direkam. Putu Evie Suyadnyani, penari Legong, membawa tarinya ke sanggar ini pada 2004."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A key with no sensor? Choose “No sensor on key …” and it uses the camera and microphone instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ada bilah tanpa sensor? Pilih “Bilah … tanpa sensor”, nanti bilah itu dibaca lewat kamera dan mikrofon."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A kotekan is a line too fast to play alone, so it is split. Neither part is the tune. The tune is what you hear when both are going." : {
      "comment" : "Explainer content for \"Kotekan\" (.kotekan guide).",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kotekan adalah jalinan nada yang terlalu cepat untuk dimainkan sendirian, jadi dibagi dua. Masing-masing bagian belum jadi melodi. Melodinya baru muncul saat keduanya dimainkan bersama."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About Mekar Bhuana" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tentang Mekar Bhuana"
