    "Tap the gangsa. Green = accepted strike · Yellow = passed gate but no fingerprint · Grey = below gate (too quiet / noise floor)." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the audio test interface.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
