    "Test each key" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tes tiap bilah"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is what Mekar Bhuana means, and it is the hope behind it: that Bali's oldest music and dance become known again, at home and beyond it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Itulah arti Mekar Bhuana, sekaligus harapan di baliknya: agar musik dan tari tertua Bali kembali dikenal, di Bali sendiri maupun di luar sana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PIN for this controller has changed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PIN kontroler ini sudah diganti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The answering half. It falls in the gaps polos leaves, off the beat — harder, and the reason the pair sounds twice as fast as either." : {
      "comment" : "Legend for the \"Sangsih\" section in the Kotekan guide.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bagian penyahut. Mengisi sela yang ditinggalkan polos, di luar ketukan — lebih sulit, dan inilah yang membuat pasangan ini terdengar dua kali lebih cepat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The answering half. You fill the gaps polos leaves — harder, more fun." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bagian penyahut. Kamu mengisi sela yang ditinggalkan polos — lebih menantang, lebih seru."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The centre" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sanggarnya"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The controller needs its PIN" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kontroler perlu PIN-nya"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The controller refused that." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kontroler menolaknya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The guide sound can hide your hits. Turn Guide off if hits are missed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Suara panduan bisa menutupi pukulanmu. Matikan Panduan kalau ada pukulan yang terlewat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The instrument" : {
      "comment" : "Title of a guide block that describes the instrument of the app.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Instrumennya"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The overview is still getting ready on this iPhone. Try again after your next session." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ringkasan masih disiapkan di iPhone ini. Coba lagi setelah sesi berikutnya, ya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The panel" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Panel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pattern has to come round at least once. Give it a full pass of the gong cycle and the score has something to measure." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Polanya perlu berputar minimal sekali. Mainkan satu putaran gong penuh, supaya ada yang bisa dinilai."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pattern you are playing, and how many times it has come round. There is no total to reach — it loops until you end it from the pause button." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pola yang sedang kamu mainkan, dan sudah berapa putaran. Tidak ada target yang harus dikejar — polanya terus berulang sampai kamu mengakhirinya lewat tombol jeda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The straight half. It lands on the beat with the kajar and holds the frame steady. This is the one to learn first." : {
      "comment" : "Text describing the role and importance of the polos in a kotekan.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bagian pokok. Jatuh tepat di ketukan bersama kajar dan menjaga iramanya tetap ajek. Mulailah belajar dari bagian ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The straight half. You land on the pulse and hold the frame steady." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bagian pokok. Kamu memukul tepat di ketukan dan menjaga iramanya tetap ajek."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sweep" : {
      "comment" : "A caption describing the sweep of a card.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Garis penunjuk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voices" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Suara"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their sensors are in each other's inputs — Remap swaps them. Try again if you hit another bilah." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sensor keduanya tertukar input — ketuk Tukar untuk membetulkannya. Coba lagi kalau tadi salah pukul bilah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then plug each sensor into the controller and switch it on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lalu colokkan tiap sensor ke kontroler dan nyalakan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Apple ID already has an account" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple ID ini sudah punya akun"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This controller can't detect them. You'll mark keys without a sensor next." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kontroler ini tidak bisa mendeteksinya. Nanti kamu tandai sendiri bilah yang tanpa sensor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This gangsa" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gangsa ini"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This key has no sensor yet. Hit it to assign one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bilah ini belum punya sensor. Pukul bilahnya untuk memasangkan sensor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tilted view" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tampilan miring"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To blossom around the world" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mekar ke seluruh penjuru dunia"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too many wrong PINs. Try again in %lld s." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Terlalu banyak PIN salah. Coba lagi dalam %lld dtk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tracking" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "yang Presisi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try again" : {
      "comment" : "Text for the button to try again.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Coba lagi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Apple Intelligence in Settings to get an overview of each session." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nyalakan Apple Intelligence di Pengaturan untuk dapat ringkasan tiap sesi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Bluetooth and switch the controller on. An active controller shows up on the right." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nyalakan Bluetooth dan kontrolernya. Kontroler yang aktif akan muncul di kanan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn the controller on, clip a sensor to each bilah, and plug them in. It connects over Bluetooth by itself." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nyalakan kontroler, jepit sensor di tiap bilah, lalu colokkan. Kontroler akan tersambung sendiri lewat Bluetooth."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Twenty-seven gamelan sets: twenty-two in Bali, five at Mekar Bhuana Aotearoa in New Zealand. Among them a Semara Patangian in the old key order that exists nowhere else outside Bali, and Semara Kirang, an Angklung set from Lombok restored in 2019." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dua puluh tujuh barung gamelan: dua puluh dua di Bali, lima di Mekar Bhuana Aotearoa, Selandia Baru. Di antaranya ada Semara Patangian dengan urutan nada lama yang tidak ditemukan di luar Bali, dan Semara Kirang, gamelan Angklung dari Lombok yang dipugar pada 2019."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Batalkan"
